{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:30 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文美國盡騷低胸上圍  「東張女神」馬路中心撥髮踎低狂打卡  網民直呼好危險\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3bc72587eac81a3b19bd70553ce2959a/2026-10/881_4.jpg\"/>\n<p>現年26歲、曾參選2023年度香港小姐競選並晉身決賽的「東張女神」鄧凱文（Eunice），憑藉火辣身材及甜美笑容，一直深受網民喜愛，更被不少粉絲封為新一代「真女神」。</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文超低胸遊美國</h2>\n<p>近日她趁著假期飛往美國旅行，並不忘在IG大發福利，分享了多張在當地拍攝的性感美照，瞬間掀起網民熱烈討論。從曝光的旅行相片可見，身處當地的鄧凱文狀態大勇，在加州溫暖陽光與晚霞的折射下，她的皮膚顯得格外白皙細緻。她留著一頭微捲的深色長髮，隨風輕輕飄逸，顯得風情萬種。打扮方面，她身穿一條白色絲質低胸吊帶連衣裙，緊身的設計將其玲瓏有致的S形曲線表露無遺。面對鏡頭，她不時展現招牌的甜美笑容，眼神電力十足，流露出極具女性魅力的嫵媚神態。最震撼視覺的莫過於吊帶裙的深V剪裁，讓她的傲人上圍呼之欲出，令大批網民紛紛直呼「流鼻血」，不論是以舊金山金門大橋為背景，還是站在充滿陽光的花園前，她的性感打扮都與當地的異國風情完美融合。</p>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文於《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2025》當晚於台下落力為《東張西望》打氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a72ec9095c56baa27cb0814b7c294c4/2026-01/VS--Instagram-0_00_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文緊張得雙手握掌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b79f572f87cf2877aaf664048a68cec/2026-01/VS--Instagram-0_02_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文夾得上圍更澎湃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5deab857b5fc4f492185f2d596686f68/2026-01/VS--Instagram-0_04_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文俯身忘情打氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccf4ed40aaf382d1c1b9da35bf0a110a/2026-01/VS--Instagram-0_08_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文到美國旅行，盡騷性感傲人身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe8abd4912d3adac3d1325d9d02a2cda/2026-10/1_4_126.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文上圍極豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5095fd8733310871e02595abc948935b/2026-10/2_2_122.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文到美國的馬路中心打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c850ee308f53aad6806fcbee3b448f5e/2026-10/3_92.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文擺出多個姿勢打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/315a0c728d58f8f790c5868747f72d4f/2026-10/4_5_85.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文的打卡照讓粉絲擔心會發生危險。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41aa8a5d6fc910738f813a90a050f938/2026-10/5_0_72.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前突然於IG鋪性感婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eacc951e19d7cfc43e40e25b6985617f/2026-06/1_13_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文表情十分嫵媚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c1f3ce1e4dbbcc01a5e9beb3a130481/2026-06/2_8_26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"去年鄧凱文採訪曾志偉的一張照片引發熱議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46fbea4926bfc8d465d225e49096ad79/2026-05/11_4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文表示該張照片「只是發生在幾秒內的事」，重申跟曾志偉沒有身體接觸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd0b06cadcd312063d78b38171e08add/2026-05/12_4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文指未來會注意言行舉止。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2345006cbc316bf8956ece6d9e350602/2026-05/13_3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文首得TVB頒發的獎項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6144a4da0399616bfdf0665c4778ff33/2026-05/14_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前到韓國，於酒店房內展現性感狀態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d934b5907a5c2a8974911b066c027a95/2026-04/1_7_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文身材一流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fefdce2a4d8d83c86bc7611c937236d4/2026-04/5_4_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前大發福利圖，她於彩虹邨盡情遊玩打卡，非常吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd43a5e41bff525c9c70d5928d7e2143/2025-04/1_1_40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前大發福利圖，她於彩虹邨盡情遊玩打卡，非常吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c8ec236765c161ccdfc5436c67bc579/2025-04/2_1_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文的背心短裙盡展美好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/262a619d14253675769353e59a7382a6/2025-04/3_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文腿張開動作大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d1de53eda03f36b5e6a635553c69895/2025-04/4_0_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文腿張開動作大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a955950cf46071382ba7b254c5d3303/2025-04/5_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文盡騷長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d215d9f12668deb2cb3a059eb2e1316e/2025-04/6_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文盡騷長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ae1289adf0df4c7af0cf8aaa364bfa1/2025-04/7_0_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文盡騷長腿，意外走光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e2019476b8f4801b1459420e37c7e50/2025-04/8_0_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文於彩虹邨盡情打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75ac3f8ca409a3d36ed307916d3aafec/2025-04/9_32.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鄧凱文於馬路中心打卡</h2>\n<p>除了在風景區留影外，鄧凱文還分享了一組在市區街道打卡的相片，然而這組照片的拍攝地點卻讓不少粉絲捏了一把汗。畫面中，鄧凱文身穿同一套白色絲質吊帶裙，站在著名的陡峭斜坡馬路中央的纜車軌道上。她不僅大方地對著鏡頭回眸一笑、撥弄秀髮，更見她大膽地在軌道交界處直接蹲下擺出誘人甫士，大晒白皙美腿與S形曲線。</p>\n<h2>鄧凱文擺性感甫士不顧安全？</h2>\n<p>雖然照片構圖極具張力，但仔細觀察背景，她的身後及右側清楚見到有許多正在行駛或停泊的車輛，包括大型貨車、私家車及電單車，旁邊甚至還有行人走過。相片曝光後，雖然有大批網民激讚畫面唯美、身材火辣，但亦有Fans留言表示極度擔憂，指出在馬路中央打卡太過危險，旁邊那麼多車輛穿梭，萬一有車衝下來後果不堪設想。大家都紛紛溫馨提示並叮囑她，出外旅遊享受美景之餘，也要時刻注意交通安全。</p>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文於農曆新年，穿上旗袍打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9f93d10d536a9ca916de6eba9f4c90f/2025-01/TANG_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文到文武廟拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8aa1091910fdcdab38644462b04a80e/2025-01/TANG_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文背後藏玄機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20ee90b4992bfb8149c8df170b39b326/2025-01/TANG_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文換上一襲火紅晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3897287101d20695b5943ff8ca6188a/2025-01/TANG_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文若隱若現晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc0f7996335fc2ba5b51aff4fee2264f/2025-01/TANG_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文打扮性感又低調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bddd5191328aee2d136ba73dbd2b766/2025-01/TANG_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文胸前以see through設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bb29b41639086af363ad9a2920013f9/2025-01/TANG_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文又露背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5acb8cec495022edc652c476d4a6eb6/2025-01/TANG_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文又換上另一套晚裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5b4116d8dcf974b8b6ac84b15abaa78/2025-01/TANG_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文大晒豐滿身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ae55413c3f5c58e76e3b639f7f6d23f/2025-01/TANG_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前生日分享靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1851569269580ac1118458fe9ede43b0/2025-02/ErisTang_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文早前在IG分享靚相，慶祝25歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7cf5fb6e36f476bf2aa3d09ed573672/2025-02/ErisTang_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文將忌廉塗在鼻尖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc30a32e7f0fc227e239272ee248e383/2025-02/ErisTang_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文一身打扮好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48b0a7b6afa0a55f2d24b188ec2bbfe4/2025-02/ErisTang_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文打扮性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4d780006e3b09ceca9a5a1f7bfb4f8c/2025-02/ErisTang_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文穿上紫色禮服，重點在於胸前位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28c6a0cbdd4470d7b82535bdb346967a/2025-02/ErisTang_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文僅以星星扣固定避免走光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a4dd2deed4a18fa1273113cc9ebaf1e/2025-02/ErisTang_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文大晒長腿，打扮非常性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d5062730f04156f6ff9637b3e2a9234/2025-02/ErisTang_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文在IG曝光拍攝花絮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11bc0ef9de48c44036c48ec57192a11f/2025-02/ErisTang_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文拍攝時轉換姿勢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5620d544d5ad5ba9a877cf87980fd02/2025-02/ErisTang_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧凱文不慎走光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c45103d2311efb45bdbaa87e12f0e315/2025-02/01_19.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:37.778712+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":787,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:48.240772+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:34.181349+00:00","content_hash":"d238a8f831cab5f6ed2d308fa330454dcd35d8c7263fc0a9a7fe24fb14563b64","evidence_status":"full","sc